    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333940/extras/67e7d2f450d00d21748b4c27cef8dc60.poster.avif?t=1754994945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333940/extras/67e7d2f450d00d21748b4c27cef8dc60.webm?t=1754994945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333940/extras/67e7d2f450d00d21748b4c27cef8dc60.mp4?t=1754994945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUCK WITH STYLE. BLOW WITH PURPOSE. CLEAN WITH CHAOS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of ACUVAC, a physics-driven canister vacuum with a mind of its own, in a destructive cleaning adventure. Use your hose to suck up, blow away, and manipulate the world around you in unexpected ways. Uncover, clean, and conquer every corner of this whimsical, robot-run world where anything goes, and chaos is all part of the fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY INSPIRED BY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katamari Damacy</strong> \u2013 Engage in playful large-scale object interaction paired with satisfying physics-based gameplay. Similar to Katamari: <u>All objects are is disposable!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luigi\u2019s Mansion</strong> \u2013 Use <u>powerful suction and airflow mechanics</u> to manipulate the environment, open up cupboards, collect hidden stuff, and clean out everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Octodad: Dadliest Catch</strong> \u2013 Control a flexible, limb-like hose that bends and swings, <u>physically interacting with every object and obstacle</u> in a fun, silly, and memorable way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It separates itself from those three games with its own brand of consistent controls that are <strong>difficult to learn but easy to master</strong>. With a <u>high skill ceiling and lots of content</u>, you're sure to feel satisfied and get that extra bang for your buck!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLEAN:</strong><br>Vacuum trash, smash objects, and creatively interact with environments to complete objectives. Be the overachiever and super-clean the level, clearing out every object in sight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT:</strong> <br>Every unique object collected gets added to your own residence (Yes, <u>ACUVAC has their own house!</u>) Unlock new levels, arcade machines, and quirky cosmetics by earning medals and discovering hidden collectibles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER:</strong><br>Master every challenge across varied sandbox levels. Take on unique tasks, unlock loads of special bonus levels, and compete in local-multiplayer modes. There's plenty of challenge and lots of different surprises to uncover!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST IT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one of the most creative, chaotic, and satisfying physics-based adventures. Add <strong>ACUVAC: A Suck and Blow Adventure</strong> to your <u><strong>Wishlist</strong></u> today and get ready to turn cleaning into chaos! </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333940/extras/67e7d2f450d00d21748b4c27cef8dc60.poster.avif?t=1754994945\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333940/extras/67e7d2f450d00d21748b4c27cef8dc60.webm?t=1754994945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333940/extras/67e7d2f450d00d21748b4c27cef8dc60.mp4?t=1754994945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SUCK WITH STYLE. BLOW WITH PURPOSE. CLEAN WITH CHAOS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of ACUVAC, a physics-driven canister vacuum with a mind of its own, in a destructive cleaning adventure. Use your hose to suck up, blow away, and manipulate the world around you in unexpected ways. Uncover, clean, and conquer every corner of this whimsical, robot-run world where anything goes, and chaos is all part of the fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY INSPIRED BY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Katamari Damacy</strong> \u2013 Engage in playful large-scale object interaction paired with satisfying physics-based gameplay. Similar to Katamari: <u>All objects are is disposable!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luigi\u2019s Mansion</strong> \u2013 Use <u>powerful suction and airflow mechanics</u> to manipulate the environment, open up cupboards, collect hidden stuff, and clean out everything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Octodad: Dadliest Catch</strong> \u2013 Control a flexible, limb-like hose that bends and swings, <u>physically interacting with every object and obstacle</u> in a fun, silly, and memorable way. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It separates itself from those three games with its own brand of consistent controls that are <strong>difficult to learn but easy to master</strong>. With a <u>high skill ceiling and lots of content</u>, you're sure to feel satisfied and get that extra bang for your buck!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT YOU'LL DO:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CLEAN:</strong><br>Vacuum trash, smash objects, and creatively interact with environments to complete objectives. Be the overachiever and super-clean the level, clearing out every object in sight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT:</strong> <br>Every unique object collected gets added to your own residence (Yes, <u>ACUVAC has their own house!</u>) Unlock new levels, arcade machines, and quirky cosmetics by earning medals and discovering hidden collectibles. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONQUER:</strong><br>Master every challenge across varied sandbox levels. Take on unique tasks, unlock loads of special bonus levels, and compete in local-multiplayer modes. There's plenty of challenge and lots of different surprises to uncover!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WISHLIST IT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience one of the most creative, chaotic, and satisfying physics-based adventures. Add <strong>ACUVAC: A Suck and Blow Adventure</strong> to your <u><strong>Wishlist</strong></u> today and get ready to turn cleaning into chaos! </p>",
    "short_description": "Suck! Blow! Swing your hose around! In this physics-based action-adventure, you'll become ACUVAC, the world's most chaotic canister vacuum. Smash, clean, and overachieve your way through ridiculous challenges in a robot-run world. Cleaning has never been this messy \u2014 or this much fun!",
